@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FitLife";
}

<style>
    body {
        background-color: #F4F1EE;
        color: #4A4A4A;
    }

    .hero {
        background-color: #FFFFFF;
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 45px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        margin-top: 50px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        color: #6B7A75;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero p {
        color: #777;
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    .menu-card {
        background-color: #FFFFFF;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 30px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        text-align: center;
        transition: 0.3s;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .menu-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card-green {
        border-top: 8px solid #A7B8A8;
    }

    .card-pink {
        border-top: 8px solid #D8B4A0;
    }

    .btn-morandi-green {
        background-color: #A7B8A8;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-morandi-green:hover {
        background-color: #8FA391;
        color: white;
    }

    .btn-morandi-pink {
        background-color: #D8B4A0;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-morandi-pink:hover {
        background-color: #C59B88;
        color: white;
    }
</style>

<div class="container">
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>FitLife 健康生活管理系統</h1>
        <p>記錄健身、飲食與每日健康變化，讓生活更有目標。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row mt-5">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="menu-card card-green">
                <h3>健身紀錄</h3>
                <p>新增、編輯、刪除運動紀錄，並查看熱量變化圖表。</p>
                <a href="/ExerciseRecords" class="btn-morandi-green">進入健身紀錄</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="menu-card card-pink">
                <h3>飲食紀錄</h3>
                <p>記錄每日餐點、餐別與攝取熱量。</p>
                <a href="/MealRecords" class="btn-morandi-pink">進入飲食紀錄</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>